  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPayroll\n\t\tPayroll FAQs\n\n### How to change a Tax Year\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 30 Mar, 2023 at 10:04 AM\n\n\t\tTo change a Tax Year once the current year’s final FPS and EPS are submitted. \n\nNavigation: Payroll > Selected client > General Settings > Change Tax Year\n\nFollowing the navigation process, a user is able to change a Tax Year once the final FPS and EPS are submitted.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
